=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Zacc} (G-9) who is standing next to {n:Enu} (G-9).
* Speak with {n:Malene} (I-5), more popularly known as the {q:Steam Clock/Bubbly Bernie|The Cold Light of Day|Steam Clock/Bubbly Bernie} quest giver.
* Return to the fountain and speak with Enu.
** __The quest will now appear in your log.__
* Acquire a {@i:Hatchet|1021} {i:Hatchet|Hatchet|1021} from the Auction House, NPC stores, or crafting.
* Travel to {z:Yuhtunga Jungle} and locate a {p:Logging Point}. Start logging and you will receive a {@i:Fallen Star|1192} {i:Fallen Star|Fallen Star|1192}.
** Yuhtunga Jungle is on Elshimo Island, accessed via airship with {@k} {k:Kazham Airship Pass} or transport to {z:Norg} via NPCs in {z:Mhaura} or {z:Selbina} (requires {M:RoV 1-5|Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Missions|RoV 1-5} or later).
* Return to Enu and trade her the star on a **clear starry night** (Clear weather, with stars visible in the sky) to complete the quest.
** Attempts during other weather conditions, including Clear weather but with overcast (clouds), will cause Enu to say "It has to be a starry night for the fallen star to work. We have to wait a little bit longer."

